# Fused phi-level addition for MLP
# Input: weight_level (8 bits) + input_level (8 bits)
# Output: combined_level (9 bits, signed)
.i 16
.o 9
.ilb w7 w6 w5 w4 w3 w2 w1 w0 x7 x6 x5 x4 x3 x2 x1 x0
.ob c8 c7 c6 c5 c4 c3 c2 c1 c0
.p 20930
